# Manual Brain — Spec

## MVP

| Feature | Requirements | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Task separation | • ability to separate tasks between Deloitte work, personal projects, and life admin<br>• ability to add new sections if needed | |
| Add tasks | • ability to add, remove, and edit tasks to each section<br>• ability to add urgency of tasks - not by due date but by relative urgency:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;- today<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2-3 days<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;- end of this week<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;- this month<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;- custom | |
| Sync with my claude/slack/gcal tool | • tool needs to feed tasks into the claude routine on slack<br>• the claude routine will pick up the tasks and assign ones that should be scheduled today - then schedule them in gcal<br>• the tool should have a gcal integration and show my gcal as a window in the site | • these are routines which currently operate in a slack channel<br>• i add tasks for the day and claude books them |
| Finish tasks | • ability to mark tasks as done, and add them to the done list | |

